749
00:49:04,860 --> 00:49:08,060
we will sit back, and we will watch and multiply our efforts.

750
00:49:08,060 --> 00:49:10,060
I don't know what that looks like.

751
00:49:10,060 --> 00:49:12,740
I hope that it doesn't mean that we fill up a second service,

752
00:49:12,740 --> 00:49:15,780
