As I send you out

932
00:58:26,400 --> 00:58:32,040
It's a prayer of benediction

933
00:58:32,040 --> 00:58:33,020
That comes from the Scripture

934
00:58:33,020 --> 00:58:34,100
We read this morning

935
00:58:34,100 --> 00:58:35,000
Father

936
00:58:35,000 --> 00:58:36,500
Father in heaven

937
00:58:36,500 --> 00:58:37,400
May we be a people

938
00:58:37,400 --> 00:58:38,960
Who don't just pretend to love others

939
00:58:38,960 --> 00:58:40,120
But really love them

940
00:58:40,120 --> 00:58:42,580
May we hate what is wrong

941
00:58:42,580 --> 00:58:44,080
And hold tightly to what is good

942
00:58:44,080 --> 00:58:46,600
May we love each other

943
00:58:46,600 --> 00:58:47,940
With genuine affection

944
00:58:47,940 --> 00:58:50,440
And take delight

945
00:58:50,440 --> 00:58:52,260
In giving honor to one another

946
00:58:52,260 --> 00:58:55,060
May we not be lazy

947
00:58:55,060 --> 00:58:56,360
But may we work hard

948
00:58:56,360 --> 00:58:58,320
And serve you enthusiastically

949
00:58:58,320 --> 00:59:00,800
May we rejoice in hope

950
00:59:00,800 --> 00:59:02,080
And be patient in trouble

951
00:59:02,080 --> 00:59:04,240
And keep on praying

952
00:59:04,240 --> 00:59:04,580
God

953
00:59:04,580 --> 00:59:06,560
May we be a church of prayer

954
00:59:06,560 --> 00:59:07,960
May this be a house of prayer

955
00:59:07,960 --> 00:59:11,620
And may we always be eager

956
00:59:11,620 --> 00:59:12,900
To practice hospitality

957
00:59:12,900 --> 00:59:14,820
For our good

958
00:59:14,820 --> 00:59:15,900
For the good of our neighbor

959
00:59:15,900 --> 00:59:17,100
And for your glory

960
00:59:17,100 --> 00:59:18,420
Amen

961
00:59:18,420 --> 00:59:20,920
Happy New Year church

962
00:59:20,920 --> 00:59:21,700
Go in peace

963
00:59:21,700 --> 00:59:23,380
And watch a bunch of NFL games

964
00:59:23,380 --> 00:59:24,620
That don't mean anything

965
00:59:24,620 --> 00:59:32,900
Next birthday

966
00:59:32,900 --> 00:59:34,900
Do whatever you want to

967
00:59:34,900 --> 00:59:38,820
And I will make room

968
00:59:38,820 --> 00:59:41,340
For you

969
00:59:41,340 --> 00:59:47,180
To do whatever you want to

970
00:59:47,180 --> 00:59:51,420
To do whatever you want to

971
00:59:51,420 --> 01:00:08,260
To do whatever you want to
